<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
    <meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
    <title>Set up two-step verification · ArtistikCity admin</title>
    <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/favicon.ico">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap">
    <link href="/css/font-awesome.css" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/ac-theme.css">
</head>
<body style="margin:0">
<main class="ac adm-login">
    <div class="adm-login__card">
        <a href="/" class="adm-login__logo"><img src="/assets/images/logo.png" alt="ArtistikCity"></a>
        <span class="adm-login__tag">Admin</span>
        <h1>Set up two-step verification</h1>
        <p class="adm-login__lede">{{#required}}Two-step verification is required for every ArtistikCity staff account. {{/required}}It takes a minute and keeps the admin safe even if your password leaks.</p>
        {{#error}}<div class="adm-login__error" role="alert"><i class="fa fa-exclamation-circle" aria-hidden="true"></i><div><p>{{error}}</p></div></div>{{/error}}
        {{#notice}}<div class="adm-mfa__note" role="status"><i class="fa fa-info-circle" aria-hidden="true"></i><div><p>{{notice}}</p></div></div>{{/notice}}
        <ol class="adm-mfa__steps">
            <li>Install an authenticator app on your phone: Google Authenticator, Microsoft Authenticator, Authy or 1Password.</li>
            <li>In the app, add an account and scan this QR code:
                <div class="adm-mfa__qr" data-testid="mfa-qr">{{{qr}}}</div>
                <details class="adm-mfa__manual"><summary>Can't scan it? Enter this key instead</summary>
                    <code data-testid="mfa-secret">{{secretGrouped}}</code><small>Account: {{email}} · time-based · 6 digits</small></details>
            </li>
            <li>Enter the 6-digit code the app shows:</li>
        </ol>
        <form method="POST" action="/admin/login/setup" novalidate>
            <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{csrf}}">
            <label for="code" class="sr-only">Authentication code</label>
            <input id="code" type="text" name="code" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9 ]*" maxlength="7" autocomplete="one-time-code" class="adm-mfa__code" placeholder="123 456" required data-testid="mfa-code">
            <button type="submit" class="adm-login__submit" data-testid="mfa-submit">Turn on and sign in</button>
        </form>
        <p class="adm-login__help"><a href="/admin/login/cancel">Cancel</a></p>
    </div>
</main>
</body>
</html>
